{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21065","headline":"荅孟东野 · 刘叉","name":"荅孟东野","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"酸寒孟夫子，苦爱老叉诗。\n生涩有百篇，谓是琼瑶辞。\n百篇非所长，忧来豁穷悲。\n唯有刚肠铁，百链不柔亏。\n退之何可駡，东野何可欺。\n文王已云没，谁顾好爵縻。\n生死守一丘，宁计饱与饥。\n万事付杯酒，从人笑狂痴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘叉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}